---
description: Explain the actual first-party chat continuity and authorized local outcome.
args:
  goal: string
  plan: ChatPlan
  opening: ChatObservation
  current: ChatObservation
  evidence: ChatEvidence
returns: ChatDisposition
---
Choose ready only when the installed delivery review verifies. Otherwise hold. Explain the relevant original receipt, consumer replay frontier or changed worker membership, and the next safe local action if the goal needs it. A connected socket, accepted input, or presently bound worker does not prove an assistant answer. A requested private decision or diagnostic records the verified outcome, including a held outcome; it does not assert that continuity is ready. When plan.note is decision, authorize that private diagnostic. When plan.note is ready-only, authorize a note only after the review is ready. When plan.note is none, leave scratch untouched. The plan and original goal bound this permission; they do not authorize membership changes or an external handoff.
